        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "Yang Perlu Diperhatikan",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n\u2022 Draft rule \u2014 bisa langsung dihapus\n\u2022 Active rule \u2014 harus di-deactivate dulu\n\u2022 Batch delete \u2014 pilih beberapa rule, hapus sekaligus\n\u2022 Kalau ragu, **Deactivate** dulu daripada hapus permanen",
